1:"publishedAt";s:25:"2026-06-05T19:15:04+00:00";s:5:"isNew";b:0;}i:4;a:8:{s:2:"id";s:32:"2957d116d3b3ab8a02bfc433130939e4";s:5:"title";s:91:"Five New Modules for Divi 5 (Timeline, Breadcrumbs, Table of Contents, SVG, Instagram Feed)";s:7:"excerpt";s:254:"We just released five new modules for Divi 5! Create beautiful, animated timelines using the timeline module. This one works great with loops. Add breadcrumbs to any page using the new breadcrumbs module; simple, but great for Theme Builder templates!...";s:3:"url";s:66:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/theme-releases/five-new-modules";s:7:"videoId";s:11:"ncrkNd0f-qA";s:16:"featuredImageUrl";s:87:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Thumbnail-2-1-300x169.png";s:11:"publishedAt";s:25:"2026-05-22T19:53:21+00:00";s:5:"isNew";b:0;}i:5;a:8:{s:2:"id";s:32:"c5078b5f1afa4a1d5a9f45f7780bd1f2";s:5:"title";s:58:"Aspect Ratio, Image Framing &amp; Image Presets for Divi 5";s:7:"excerpt";s:243:"I am excited to introduce a host of new image settings for Divi 5. First, we added new aspect ratio settings to all images. Elements with aspect ratios scale proportionally across different screen sizes. Next, we added framing settings that...";s:3:"url";s:102:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/theme-releases/aspect-ration-image-framing-image-presets-for-divi-5";s:7:"videoId";s:11:"QFKLr_qjg4Y";s:16:"featuredImageUrl";s:81:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/image-2-300x169.png";s:11:"publishedAt";s:25:"2026-05-11T17:42:47+00:00";s:5:"isNew";b:0;}i:6;a:8:{s:2:"id";s:32:"361c78260e2606416bb6658cf7b1e924";s:5:"title";s:59:"Divi 5 Sizing System &amp; Color Palette Variable Generator";s:7:"excerpt";s:244:"I am excited to introduce the Variable Generator for Divi 5. At the core of Divi 5’s design system are variables and presets. With advanced units, you can create fluid, responsive sizing systems using clamp(). With relative colors, you can...";s:3:"url";s:68:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/theme-releases/variable-generator";s:7:"videoId";s:11:"9NhPczWWBng";s:16:"featuredImageUrl";s:85:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Thumbnail-2-300x169.png";s:11:"publishedAt";s:25:"2026-04-30T21:39:03+00:00";s:5:"isNew";b:0;}i:7;a:8:{s:2:"id";s:32:"f3ba21b5a6501d7ecf6a4906355b2f89";s:5:"title";s:32:"Nested Option Presets for Divi 5";s:7:"excerpt";s:278:"Divi 5’s preset system is the most powerful class-based design system of any WordPress page builder. In fact, Divi 5 presets encapsulate far more than just CSS; they are stackable, nestable global components. Additionally, Divi offers the unique concept of option presets...";s:3:"url";s:71:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/theme-releases/nested-option-presets";s:7:"videoId";s:11:"6vtznsCcd_4";s:16:"featuredImageUrl";s:83:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/thumbnail-300x169.png";s:11:"publishedAt";s:25:"2026-04-22T17:19:08+00:00";s:5:"isNew";b:0;}i:8;a:8:{s:2:"id";s:32:"c89e1af81c6f6db21bd10924228a1b50";s:5:"title";s:76:"Better Form Styling, Field Presets, Focus Editing, And CF7 Module for Divi 5";s:7:"excerpt";s:253:"There’s so much to talk about in this Divi 5 feature update! We harmonized field options across all form-based modules, adding additional styling options for form elements such as radio buttons and checkboxes. In addition to hover editing, we added...";s:3:"url";s:109:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/theme-releases/new-form-options-field-presets-focus-editing-and-cf7-module";s:7:"videoId";s:11:"daKCyq-nXZk";s:16:"featuredImageUrl";s:76:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/D5-300x169.png";s:11:"publishedAt";s:25:"2026-04-21T18:53:11+00:00";s:5:"isNew";b:0;}i:9;a:8:{s:2:"id";s:32:"774399ce5d9d059a7c3ff92758383dbd";s:5:"title";s:56:"Composable Settings for Divi 5 (Hundreds of New Options)";s:7:"excerpt";s:256:"I am excited to introduce Composible Settings for Divi 5, allowing you to enable any of Divi’s design options for any module sub-element. This update completely harmonizes the available settings for Divi modules, which means you’ll never have to use...";s:3:"url";s:69:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/theme-releases/composable-settings";s:7:"videoId";s:11:"6H40S8mmt-I";s:16:"featuredImageUrl";s:79:"https://www.elegantthemes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/image-300x169.png";s:11:"publishedAt";s:25:"2026-03-30T20:20:32+00:00";s:5:"isNew";b:0;}}s:9:"updatedAt";i:1784786396;}','off');
